Cell["\<\
You can also find the horizon coordinates of a fixed point on the celestial \
sphere. For example:\
\>", "Text",
 ImageRegion->{{0, 1}, {0, 
  1}},ExpressionUUID->"ed7d383a-7a72-46e5-88c8-2f9a9137aaa6"],

